ux/proposals/CODEX_PROPOSAL.md:49:| `entitlement` | 액션마다 `{allowed, reasonCode, remedyAction, evaluatedRevision}`. browse/templateClone/templateBacktest/aiTask/startPaper/startLive/resumeLive/pause/stop/followStart/publish를 구분 |
ux/proposals/CODEX_PROPOSAL.md:50:| `primaryCTA`, `secondaryCTA` | `{action,labelKey,params,target,resumeIntent,enabled,reasonCode}` 또는 null. 문자열 onclick 없음 |
